{"page":186,"verses":[{"verse_key":"8:70","surah":8,"ayah":70,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّبِىُّ قُل لِّمَن فِىٓ أَيْدِيكُم مِّنَ ٱلْأَسْرَىٰٓ إِن يَعْلَمِ ٱللَّهُ فِى قُلُوبِكُمْ خَيْرًا يُؤْتِكُمْ خَيْرًا مِّمَّآ أُخِذَ مِنكُمْ وَيَغْفِرْ لَكُمْ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Prophet, tell those you have taken captive, ‘If God knows of any good in your hearts, He will give you something better than what has been taken from you, and He will forgive you: God is forgiving and merciful.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"8:70"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","en_gloss":"Prophet","transliteration":"l-nabiyu","verse_key":"8:70"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قُل","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"8:70"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِّمَن","en_gloss":"to whoever","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"8:70"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"8:70"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَيْدِيكُم","en_gloss":"your hands","transliteration":"aydīkum","verse_key":"8:70"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"8:70"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْأَسْرَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"the captives","transliteration":"l-asrā","verse_key":"8:70"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"8:70"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَعْلَمِ","en_gloss":"knows","transliteration":"yaʿlami","verse_key":"8:70"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"8:70"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"8:70"},{"pos":13,"ar":"قُلُوبِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your hearts","transliteration":"qulūbikum","verse_key":"8:70"},{"pos":14,"ar":"خَيْرًۭا","en_gloss":"any good","transliteration":"khayran","verse_key":"8:70"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يُؤْتِكُمْ","en_gloss":"He will give you","transliteration":"yu'tikum","verse_key":"8:70"},{"pos":16,"ar":"خَيْرًۭا","en_gloss":"better","transliteration":"khayran","verse_k